1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:01,440
WHEN DRACULA CAME OUT

2
00:00:01,440 --> 00:00:03,320
IN 1897,

3
00:00:03,320 --> 00:00:03,880
TRANSYLVANIA

4
00:00:03,880 --> 00:00:05,642
WASN'T IN ROMANIA.

5
00:00:06,092 --> 00:00:07,349
IT WAS IN HUNGARY.

6
00:00:08,060 --> 00:00:08,860
BRAM STOKER PUT

7
00:00:08,860 --> 00:00:10,420
THE COUNT'S CASTLE THERE.

8
00:00:10,420 --> 00:00:11,226
HE NEVER WENT.

9
00:00:11,740 --> 00:00:13,140
BACK THEN, TRANSYLVANIA

10
00:00:13,140 --> 00:00:13,860
BELONGED TO

11
00:00:13,860 --> 00:00:15,220
THE KINGDOM OF HUNGARY,

12
00:00:15,220 --> 00:00:16,959
INSIDE AUSTRIA-HUNGARY.

13
00:00:17,280 --> 00:00:18,160
ROMANIA WAS

14
00:00:18,160 --> 00:00:19,040
NEXT DOOR,

15
00:00:19,040 --> 00:00:20,313
ACROSS THE MOUNTAINS.

16
00:00:20,620 --> 00:00:22,060
THEN THE FIRST WORLD WAR

17
00:00:22,060 --> 00:00:23,300
BROKE AUSTRIA-HUNGARY

18
00:00:23,300 --> 00:00:23,989
APART.

19
00:00:24,300 --> 00:00:25,840
IN 1918,

20
00:00:25,840 --> 00:00:27,780
TRANSYLVANIA'S ROMANIAN DELEGATES

21
00:00:27,780 --> 00:00:28,780
DECLARED UNION

22
00:00:28,780 --> 00:00:30,079
WITH ROMANIA.

23
00:00:30,380 --> 00:00:30,760
A TREATY

24
00:00:30,760 --> 00:00:31,680
MADE IT OFFICIAL

25
00:00:31,680 --> 00:00:33,281
IN 1920.

26
00:00:33,681 --> 00:00:34,640
AND THE REAL DRACULA?

27
00:00:34,640 --> 00:00:35,900
VLAD THE IMPALER

28
00:00:35,900 --> 00:00:37,440
RULED WALLACHIA.

29
00:00:37,440 --> 00:00:39,210
THE OTHER SIDE OF THE MOUNTAINS.

30
00:00:39,560 --> 00:00:41,160
TODAY, A CASTLE CALLED BRAN

31
00:00:41,160 --> 00:00:42,420
IS SOLD TO TOURISTS

32
00:00:42,420 --> 00:00:44,043
AS DRACULA'S CASTLE.

33
00:00:44,360 --> 00:00:45,220
THERE'S NO EVIDENCE

34
00:00:45,220 --> 00:00:46,600
STOKER EVEN KNEW

35
00:00:46,600 --> 00:00:47,408
IT EXISTED.

36
00:00:48,160 --> 00:00:49,660
DRACULA NEVER MOVED.

37
00:00:49,660 --> 00:00:50,571
THE BORDER DID.

